{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000029621","bookName":"No te metas con esa chica gorda (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000029621/42000029621.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":6725961,"followCount":247107,"introduction":"Pasé cinco años de intenso esfuerzo transformándome de una chica gorda de la que todos se burlaban en una futura modelo internacional. Mi debut internacional será en el mismo hotel donde mis antiguos acosadores de la escuela celebrarán su reunión. Josefina, mi principal verdugo, desenterró un viejo video humillante y me etiquetó, mientras mis excompañeros apostaban a que jamás me presentaría. Respondí con calma y prometí llegar a tiempo… y hacer que todos pagaran por ello.","chapterCount":30,"labels":["Comeback Story","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Comeback Story","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"No-te-metas-con-esa-chica-gorda-Doblado","bookNameLower":"no-te-metas-con-esa-chica-gorda-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-10-07 10:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-10-07 10:00:01","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701713385","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/58/1x2/12x6/126x9/12692000024/701713385_1/701713385.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=Xu6~bmKiKdRtUsS8kd53euJG5uENZb21IShlnmq4bDQRqko2rD~e1Q3bgudCKg7FCLx5DecUuf3UPlipNlxClLG5n2o1Ty~Ww6oT13m2a2DVi6M-Ge1lrfEREgOwTEQMrJuL6NtH~9J10-~VGtO3Vf6k0dwZcI~iTlRw8PiuKCQYbfEIYozUDg3wZ26ZS-1-4atJ4tt7HYvZ2aYnMneTHgbOQh0oHCTbHxnHE7DLjLJa-73UqQLuJjHc7D6BiW0hSdQpNuOqLr45vfIdU0Izutt4bHQxQW6okFGY8RmwvqDUcwCCKHP-K5QnGh80nmAcpZ5cE29rsSVEgw8eYt3h6w__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/58/1x2/12x6/126x9/12692000024/701713385_1/701713385.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":167027,"price":0},{"id":"701713386","index":1,"unlock